@startuml
title Offline Translation Memory Indexing
skinparam shadowing false

start

:Load bilingual parallel corpus;
note right
Candidate sources from the project plan:
Samanantar, BPCC, FLORES-200
end note

:Clean text and normalize Unicode;
:Remove duplicate and invalid pairs;
:Assign record IDs and domain metadata;

:Store source-target pairs
and metadata in the TM database;

:Encode source sentences using LaBSE;
:L2-normalize sentence embeddings;
:Build or update the FAISS ANN index;
:Persist vector IDs and FAISS index;

:Validate database/index ID mapping;

stop
@enduml